# The Action's committed bundle is a build artifact, not text.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites its line
# endings on checkout, which makes `git diff --check` report trailing whitespace
# on three megabyte-long lines and makes `bun run check:dist` fail on a bundle
# that is byte-identical to the committed one. Git must not touch these bytes.
action/dist/** -text
